§§ `Part III — conditions`

-- III.1: under 12 months; 66 on first joining; 71 on renewal; disability over 80%;
-- mental illness or leprosy.
GIVEN born IS A DATE
      firstIn IS A DATE
      began IS A DATE
      disability IS A NUMBER
      mental IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An insured person`
`an employee born on` born `first insured` firstIn `cover began` began `disabled` disability `mentally ill` mental MEANS
    `a person built from` `an employee` born firstIn TRUE began TRUE TRUE mental disability TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING

#ASSERT `insurable under III.1` (`an employee born on` (YMD 1960 1 2) `first insured` (YMD 2026 1 1) `cover began` (YMD 2026 1 1) `disabled` 0 `mentally ill` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `insurable under III.1` (`an employee born on` (YMD 1960 1 1) `first insured` (YMD 2026 1 1) `cover began` (YMD 2026 1 1) `disabled` 0 `mentally ill` FALSE)
#ASSERT `insurable under III.1` (`an employee born on` (YMD 1955 1 2) `first insured` (YMD 2020 1 1) `cover began` (YMD 2026 1 1) `disabled` 0 `mentally ill` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `insurable under III.1` (`an employee born on` (YMD 1955 1 1) `first insured` (YMD 2020 1 1) `cover began` (YMD 2026 1 1) `disabled` 0 `mentally ill` FALSE)
#ASSERT `insurable under III.1` (`an employee born on` (YMD 1990 1 1) `first insured` (YMD 2026 1 1) `cover began` (YMD 2026 1 1) `disabled` 80 `mentally ill` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `insurable under III.1` (`an employee born on` (YMD 1990 1 1) `first insured` (YMD 2026 1 1) `cover began` (YMD 2026 1 1) `disabled` 81 `mentally ill` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `insurable under III.1` (`an employee born on` (YMD 1990 1 1) `first insured` (YMD 2026 1 1) `cover began` (YMD 2026 1 1) `disabled` 0 `mentally ill` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `within the ages III.1 allows` (`a child born on` (YMD 2025 1 2) `studying` FALSE `married` FALSE)

