-- III.4: notice at least 30 days before (fork F17); refunds 100% (PTI) or 80% (the
-- policyholder, if no claim paid) of the unexpired premium. The plain contract runs
-- 1 January to 31 December 2026 (364 days from first to last); from 2 July, 182 remain:
-- half of VND 3.640.000 is 1.820.000; 80% of that is 1.456.000.
#ASSERT `notice given at least 30 days before` (YMD 2026 6 2) (YMD 2026 7 2)
#ASSERT NOT `notice given at least 30 days before` (YMD 2026 6 3) (YMD 2026 7 2)
#ASSERT `the refund when` `PTI cancels` `on` (YMD 2026 7 2) `under` `the plain contract` `with claims paid` TRUE EQUALS 1820000
#ASSERT `the refund when` `the policyholder cancels` `on` (YMD 2026 7 2) `under` `the plain contract` `with claims paid` FALSE EQUALS 1456000
#ASSERT `the refund when` `the policyholder cancels` `on` (YMD 2026 7 2) `under` `the plain contract` `with claims paid` TRUE EQUALS 0

