#ASSERT `the day cover ends under` (`a contract built from` (YMD 2026 1 1) (YMD 2026 12 31) (YMD 2026 1 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 9 30)) 20 20 `all seven benefits` EMPTY `the scenario schedule` FALSE FALSE FALSE 3640000 FALSE (JUST 25000)) EQUALS YMD 2026 9 30
#ASSERT `the day cover ends under` (`a contract built from` (YMD 2026 1 1) (YMD 2026 12 31) (YMD 2026 1 1) (JUST (YMD 2027 3 1)) 20 20 `all seven benefits` EMPTY `the scenario schedule` FALSE FALSE FALSE 3640000 FALSE (JUST 25000)) EQUALS YMD 2026 12 31

-- III.7: the short-period scale, row by row; 5 and 7 months are not stated; 8 months is
