§§ `Part VI — extensions`

GIVEN theKind IS A `A kind of membership change`
      wasNotified IS A BOOLEAN
      already IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A membership change`
`a change of kind` theKind `notified` wasNotified `with dependant changes already` already MEANS
    `A membership change` WITH
        `kind`                                                    IS theKind
        `date of the change`                                      IS YMD 2026 4 1
        `notified in writing at the end of the month and confirmed by PTI` IS wasNotified
        `sum insured requested`                                   IS 150000000
        `sum insured of employees doing the same kind of work`    IS 100000000
        `dependant changes already accepted in the period`        IS already
        `a claim has arisen for the person by the date of the change` IS FALSE

GIVETH A `The contract`
`the contract with every extension` MEANS `a 2026 contract for` 60 `employees and` 120 `persons with` `every extension`

-- VI.1: automatic additions, if notified and confirmed; dependants once a period save on
-- marriage or birth; the sum insured no higher than for the same kind of work.
#ASSERT `the date VI.1 gives effect to` (`a change of kind` `a new employee` `notified` TRUE `with dependant changes already` 0) `under` `the contract with every extension` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 4 1)
#ASSERT `the date VI.1 gives effect to` (`a change of kind` `a new employee` `notified` FALSE `with dependant changes already` 0) `under` `the contract with every extension` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the date VI.1 gives effect to` (`a change of kind` `a new employee` `notified` TRUE `with dependant changes already` 0) `under` `the plain contract` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the date VI.1 gives effect to` (`a change of kind` `a dependant added` `notified` TRUE `with dependant changes already` 1) `under` `the contract with every extension` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the date VI.1 gives effect to` (`a change of kind` `a dependant added on the employee's marriage or a birth` `notified` TRUE `with dependant changes already` 1) `under` `the contract with every extension` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 4 1)
#ASSERT `the sum insured VI.1 allows for` (`a change of kind` `a new employee` `notified` TRUE `with dependant changes already` 0) EQUALS 100000000
