#ASSERT `the day cover ends under the warranty, for` `the contract with every extension` `paid on` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 3)) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 3 2)
#ASSERT `the day cover ends under the warranty, for` `the contract with every extension` `paid on` NOTHING EQUALS JUST (YMD 2026 3 2)
