        `date the documents were sent`                          IS submittedOn
        `date supplementary documents were requested`           IS requestedOn
        `date supplementary documents were submitted`           IS suppliedOn
        `force majeure`                                         IS isForce
        `an invoice lumps several kinds of cost together`       IS FALSE
        `documents supplied`                                    IS EMPTY

