#ASSERT `the yearly premium in US dollars at` `Level B` EQUALS 20

GIVEN hours IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      allowed IS A BOOLEAN
      excused IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A call to the assistance centre`
`a call notified after` hours `access` allowed `excuse` excused MEANS
    `A call to the assistance centre` WITH
        `name, policy number and expiry date given`                 IS TRUE
        `telephone number and location given`                       IS TRUE
        `short description of the condition given`                  IS TRUE
        `hours from admission to notifying the assistance company`  IS hours
        `the medical team allowed access to the insured`            IS allowed
        `a reasonable excuse for not complying`                     IS excused

GIVEN service  IS A `A transport service`
      cost     IS A NUMBER
      away     IS A NUMBER
      approved IS A BOOLEAN
      paid     IS A NUMBER
      call     IS A `A call to the assistance centre`
GIVETH A `The transport`
`a transport` service `costing` cost `after` away `days away, approved` approved `with` paid `paid before, and` call MEANS
    `The transport` WITH
        `service`                                              IS service
        `cost, in US dollars`                                  IS cost
        `consecutive days away from the declared residence`    IS away
        `within Vietnam`                                       IS TRUE
        `in a critical condition`                              IS TRUE
        `the necessary treatment unavailable where the accident happened` IS TRUE
        `approved by PTI beforehand`                           IS approved
        `certified by the treating doctor as unavailable there` IS TRUE
        `transport costs already paid in the period, in US dollars` IS paid
        `the call`                                             IS call

GIVETH A `A call to the assistance centre`
`a timely call` MEANS `a call notified after` (JUST 24) `access` TRUE `excuse` FALSE

